r\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070319014306&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beer_Cask_eeeea2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a beer cask.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>You can find these throughout whole <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>, in most cities and in some buildings and creature settlements. There is one in Thais, in Frodo's tavern.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It can be used to fill <a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Fluid Containers</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">beer</a>.<br/>\nIt looks the same as a Lemonade Cask, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale\">Cask of Brown Ale</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale%20%28Item%29\">Cask of Brown Ale (Item)</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Cask\">Small Cask</a>, a Water Cask and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine%20Cask\">Wine Cask</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale\">Cask of Brown Ale</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale%20%28Item%29\">Cask of Brown Ale (Item)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Casks</a></li><li>Castle of the White Dragon</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li>Crystal Glance</li><li>Frodo's Hut</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Manor\">Frost Manor</a></li><li>Golden Axe Guildhall</li><li>Granite Guildhall</li><li>Halls of the Adventurers</li><li>Hill Hideout</li><li>Iron Guildhall</li><li>Lemonade Cask</li><li>Mammoth Belly</li><li>Marble Guildhall</li><li>Other Objects</li><li>Port Hope Tavern</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/power-ring-quest\">Power Ring Quest</a></li><li>Riverspring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rum%20Cask\">Rum Cask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Cask\">Small Cask</a></li><li>Snake Tower</li><li>Southern Thais Guildhall</li><li>Stars Effect</li><li>Valorous Venore</li><li>Warriors' Guildhall</li><li>Water Cask</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wine%20Cask\">Wine Cask</a></li><li>Wolftower</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["power-ring-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"power-ring-quest","quest":"Power Ring Quest","step":"1-2","n":7,"title":"Abrir as caixas de quest","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}